Error [jet.DimensionMismatch]: `+` can't combine Length with Time
  --> tests/ui/quantity_dimension_mismatch.jet:4:10
    |
  4 |     bad: 1meter + 1s
    |          ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Physical quantities must have compatible dimensions before they can be added, subtracted, or compared
 Fix: Use matching dimensions, or use `*` or `/` to derive a new dimension
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0359

Error [jet.DimensionMismatch]: `<` can't combine Length with Scalar
  --> tests/ui/quantity_dimension_mismatch.jet:5:15
    |
  5 |     also_bad: 1meter < 1.0
    |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Physical quantities must have compatible dimensions before they can be added, subtracted, or compared
 Fix: Use matching dimensions, or use `*` or `/` to derive a new dimension
